        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Private Music\n- People: Ringo Starr, Etta James, Taj Mahal, A. J. Croce, Richard Starkey\n- Products: Love's Been Rough on Me\n- Topics: new-age music, mainstream music, the Beatles\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Starkey was born on 7 July 1940 and is professionally known as Ringo Starr.\n- Ringo Starr is an English drummer, singer, songwriter, and actor who gained worldwide fame as the drummer for the Beatles.\n- Private Music specialized in new-age music before making a sharp turn toward the mainstream.\n- Private Music signed Taj Mahal, Ringo Starr, Etta James, and A. J. Croce as part of its move toward mainstream music.\n- Love's Been Rough on Me is the twenty-second studio album by Etta James.\n- Love's Been Rough on Me was released in 1997 through Private Music.",
